{
  "$comment": "A FIXTURE for Spell UI's design tools' tests:  two families of spell-brand's docs set data (its docs/__data/components.json5, 2026-10-20), cut down.  Spell UI may not read the brand's repo, which is above it (epic repo-split P8).",
